# a new project with every slot full has no slot: HOME's list shows LOAD PROJECT and SAVE TO on other slots, and is
# built every frame; whether a slot holds a project is read from the flash once, not every frame (a store read keeps
# interrupts off a while: the LED scan stalled and the black keys' mid level flickered under the list)
wait 300
projsave 1
projsave 2
projsave 3
tap HOME
tap SEL
row NEW PROJECT
tap SEL
wait 100
tap SEL
wait 200
tap HOME
tap SEL
expect listopen 1
wait 1000
expect slot_reads <4
# a row turned to another slot: read once, then known
row LOAD PROJECT
turn ALGO 1
wait 1000
expect slot_reads <5
tap HOME
